 "text": "St Joseph County IN GIS\n-->\n-->\nSkip Navigation\nAdd to Favorites\nTranslate\nAdd to Favorites\nTranslate\nClose\nSign In\nExplore\nData\nDocuments\nApps & Maps\nRecent Downloads\nNew\nSign In\nToggle navigation\nGovernment\nDepartments\nBusiness\nResidents\nHow Do I...\nSt Joseph County, IN. GIS\nSearch, Access, & Connect with SJC\nSJC GIS Map Full Screen\nAdditional County Maps: SJC Map Gallery\nDashboards & Storymaps\nDownload Maps\nMaps can be made available in custom size and in hard-copy for a fee.\nRequest your custom map with the SJC GIS Staff.\nGeneral Information Maps About Boundaries Within St. Joseph County.\nLocal Reference Maps Within St. Joseph County.\nVoter Precinct Maps Corresponding to Multiple References.\nLegislative Maps Within St. Joseph County.\nData Portal\nDownload\nlimited version datasets through this open data portal for free.\nIf the Requested Layer(s) is for the entire County a Provisional Data Usage Agreement\nwill need to be completed and a $200 fee (for each layer) will need to be collected prior to sending the layer.\nParcel Boundaries\nProperty\nTransportation\nPlanning\nMunicipal\nEnvironmental\nSource\nSt. Joseph County, GIS Staff\nDepartment of Infrastructure, Planning, & Growth\nAddress\n227 W. Jefferson Blvd.\nCounty Services Building,\nSuite 1140\nSouth Bend, IN. 46601\nContact Us\nBeverly Kingston - GIS Manager\n574-235-7800 (Ext: 7826)\nChase Alvey - GIS Technician\n574-235-7800 (Ext. 7825)\nLinks\nSt. Joseph County Website\nRegional GIS Website\nCopyright 2021: St. Joseph County, IN.\nThe information on\nthis site is provided as a reference and does not replace official\nnotices or publications. Although the pages are routinely updated, there\nmay be delays in posting changes. Any questions about the site can be directed to the St. Joseph County GIS Department.\nBuilt with\nArcGIS Hub\nExplore Feeds\nTranslate",
